step Onyxia's eggs
  tip The Eggs of Onyxia lie in the dragon caves in the Wyrmbog's south-east, guarded by the scalebanes; smash five.
  goto 53.4,74.7 "Dragon caves"
  interact 20359 quest 1172.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Level 45.37
  when !group 1173
  when level<45.37
  tip Overlord Mok'Morokk's challenge, back in Brackenwall, needs a group of three. Alone, grind the Firemane scouts here on the Wyrmbog's northern edge to level 45.37 before you ride back north, so you don't come back down for it. Or, with a group, run the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead.
  goto 37.5,68.3 map 1445 "Firemane Scout"
  level 45.37 grind 4329               -- grind on Firemane Scout

