# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Forgotten Coast

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Ride north-west to the Forgotten Coast; Zorbin waits on the dock.
  accept 7003

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: screechers and OOX-22/FE

step Rogue Vale screechers
  tip Rogue Vale opens just north of Zorbin's dock. Kill a Rogue Vale Screecher, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on its body before you loot it, then talk to the spirit that rises: it is friendly. Three spirits in all.
  use 10699 "Yeh'kinya's Bramble" quest 3520.1 @45.0,38.0
  talk 8612 quest 3520.1

step The Forgotten Coast: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip The Sea Sprays (47-48) wash along the shore just south of the dock: they drop the Water Elemental Cores as well as the Sea Elementals (48-49) do. The Wave and Deep Striders (47-49) wade in the water off the same beach: zap them with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first, and shrunken they lose their elite strength. Leave the Land Walkers and Cliff Giants (48-50) of the northern hills for your next Feralas visit.
  tip The Ultra-Shrinker lasts two hours: hand both quests back to Zorbin before you leave the coast.
  use 18904 quest 7003.1 @44.12,49.08 map 1444 -- Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker, on the Wave and Deep Striders in the water
  collect 18956 quest 7003.1

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Back to Zorbin on the dock.
  turnin 7003

step Rage Scar yetis
  tip On the way back south-east from the coast, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills by the road. Any of them can also drop a Perfect Yeti Hide, which starts a quest of its own.
  collect 18947 quest 7734.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 18972 optional                -- Perfect Yeti Hide, a rare drop
  accept 7738 optional

